{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12105310","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12105310","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1210531001:1":{"text":"I didn't know the secret passageway was this big.","source_cn":"这里……居然有这么大的密道！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE8D3A06659DBB9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1210531001":{"text":"I didn't know the secret passageway was this big.","source_cn":"这里……居然有这么大的密道！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE8D3A06659DBB9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210531002:0":{"text":"It's funny. If the Water Wights had never attacked, you would've never found this secret passageway.","source_cn":"真稀奇，是不是如果没有今天的事，水鬼把刀架在你们脖子上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BC0203C878A788E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210531003:1":{"text":"I thought the Whispers were all-seeing, but it turns out you wouldn't notice a rat even if it was gnawing under your floorboards.","source_cn":"还以为血薇帮手眼通天，结果连眼皮下的耗子都发现不了。你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BC64431F1F05AE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210531004:1":{"text":"Shut up, you noisy seagull!","source_cn":"住口，无礼的家伙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x